{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object if approached, if not approach, take, check properties, and perform task. Avoid obstacles, explore.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
